ff-shoulder silk chiffon gown, the fabric appearing soft and flowing with enhanced material textures. The dress is designed with a golden waist-to-hip ratio of 0.65, showcasing natural curves with subtle chest contours, avoiding excessive exaggeration. Her left shoulder strap delicately slips down 15cm, with the hem of her gown flowing at a precise 45-degree arc due to a simulated east-southeast wind at 3.8m/s. Her dark hair waves gently in the breeze, following fluid dynamics principles, creating a natural and elegant motion.\n\nShe stands on Shanghai's Wukang Road, bathed in dappled light filtering through plane tree leaves, holding a 24×16cm crocodile-textured handbag. The background features 12 plane tree leaves falling per second, their movement harmonizing with the scene. Soft sunlight at 5600K color temperature pierces through the tree canopy, forming exquisite Tyndall light patterns. The image is captured with an 85mm portrait lens and a soft-focus filter, emphasizing texture details, specular highlights, and realistic cloth dynamics.\n\n**Top-left image:**  \nA close-up of her delicate face, eyes gently closed as she sings, radiating serenity and emotion. Her fair complexion glows under the warm light, accentuated by a soft blush. Her dark wavy hair is styled in a loose updo, adorned with a white lace-trimmed hat. The intricate details of her features are highlighted, creating a sense of intimacy.\n\n**Top-right image:**  \nA right-side profile of the woman, showcasing her poised and graceful expression as she sings. Her lips are slightly parted, revealing a hint of vulnerability and passion. A pearl necklace rests elegantly on her collarbone, glinting subtly under the warm light. The softly blurred background consists of muted pastel walls and antique furnishings, adding a vintage charm.\n\n**Bottom-left image:**  \nA left-side profile capturing the woman’s expressive gaze, filled with emotion as she sings. The vintage dress drapes gracefully over her figure, with the ambient lighting emphasizing the texture of the fabric and the delicate lace details. Her posture conveys elegance and poise, blending seamlessly into the nostalgic atmosphere.\n\n**Bottom-right image:**  \nA medium shot of the woman, showcasing her full figure and flowing vintage dress as she sings with heartfelt emotion. Her hands rest gently at her sides, her posture confident yet graceful. The softly lit background includes lace curtains and warm wooden tones, enhancing the scene's nostalgic and romantic ambiance.\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 269, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 115, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 33}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [230], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [514.6087646484375, 153.9936981201172], "pos": [2368.938720703125, 1410.273681640625], "widgets_values": ["A right-side profile, showing her poised expression as she sings. Her lips are slightly parted, and her pearl necklace rests elegantly on her collarbone. The softly blurred background features muted pastel walls and antique furnishings."], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 67, "type": "JjkText", "title": "右上角分镜", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [239], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [528.7988891601562, 154.27818298339844], "pos": [1825.28173828125, 1415.63623046875], "widgets_values": ["A close-up of her delicate face, eyes gently closed as she sings. The warm light enhances her fair complexion, soft blush, and dark wavy hair styled in a loose updo with a white lace-trimmed hat."], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 80, "type": "JjkText", "title": "左上角分镜", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "or